				<li><a href="https://get.adobe.com/kr/reader/" target="_blank" class="baseBtn xlarge pdfView btnPdf pdfView"><span class="base">PDF뷰어 다운로드</span></a></li>
				
				<li><a href="#none" id="pdfFullBtn" class="baseBtn xlarge gray btnPdf fullView" title="새창열림"><span class="base">전체화면으로 보기</span></a></li>
